{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26289","headline":"别庞子肃 · 沈亚之","name":"别庞子肃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自爲应仙才，丹砂链几回。\n山秋梦桂树，月晓忆瑶台。\n雨雪依岩避，烟云逐步开。\n今朝龙杖去，早晚鹤书来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}